@startuml
title Redis Commander - Sentinel Connection and Failover
autonumber

actor User
participant "Profile Selector" as Selector
participant RedisCommanderUI as UI
participant RedisClient as Client
participant "Sentinel 1..N" as Sentinel
participant "Current Master" as Master
participant "Healthy Replicas" as Replicas

User -> Selector : select Sentinel profile + Enter
Selector -> UI : connect_to_profile()
UI -> Client : Sentinel AUTH/TLS settings
Client -> Sentinel : discover master + replicas
Sentinel --> Client : topology
Client -> Master : PING
Client --> UI : connected
UI --> User : DB/key interface

UI -> Master : background SCAN + TYPE pipeline
UI -> Master : writes and console commands
UI -> Replicas : eligible value reads

== Failover ==
Master --> Client : READONLY / MASTERDOWN / connection error
Client -> Sentinel : refresh topology
Sentinel --> Client : new master + replicas
Client -> Client : replace pools
Client --> UI : retry safe operation or report ambiguous write

User -> UI : Disconnect
UI -> Client : close all pools
UI --> Selector : return

@enduml
